# v1.0.3

## Required Environment

- Game patch: FFXIV 7.56, hotfix 2
- Dalamud: v15.0.3.5 (API 15)

## Changelog

### New Features

- **Resume after a stop.** After you stop a run, the Orders panel offers Resume to continue it while the order is unchanged, and Start over to begin fresh. (`50581e01a`, `03cad58a3`)
- **Alert sign.** A clickable sign appears over your character when a run fails or goes on hold, and clicking it dismisses the alert. (`9adf47051`)
- **Hold reasons in the desktop app.** The app lists why a run is on hold, one line per problem, and marks a run that never started as Did not start. (`a17bcc0c4`)
- **Retainers settings in the desktop app.** You choose which retainers store items and in what order, and the Stocking settings point out problems in your lines. (`64c73e5f9`)
- **Expert model count.** General settings in the plugin and the app show how many expert crafting models are installed and name any that are missing. (`5c2fe6407`)
- **Leve orders (beta).** You can add a delivery leve to an order in the in-game Orders panel by typing its ID, and the run turns the leve in once its items are ready. (`f312bd585`)
- Drakos can complete the quest A Home in the Firmament on its own. (`0a9711f50`)

### Improvements

- Once a run starts a task, it finishes that task before switching to another one. (`0451e70f7`)
- A new market-board purchase line gets a 100-gil cap per unit unless you type 0 for no limit, and a new selling watchlist item starts with a 100,000-gil price floor. (`83b7ca7ad`, `1c672e3b0`)
- Ephemeral node gathering plans its visits from the real travel time between that zone's nodes, so the plan matches what actually gets gathered. (`cf49f29aa`, `202885fdd`)
- The desktop app tells you to check the external connection in game when it finds no characters. (`d9822e242`)

### Fixes

- A full bag at the scrip cap now puts the run on hold once and names the full bag, instead of leaving the run waiting or replanning for hours. (`4973fb1d3`)
- Talking to an NPC right after dismounting no longer fails because the game thinks you are jumping. (`00198364d`)
- Price changes at a retainer no longer fail after a Compare Prices result that never arrived. (`b8c306b9e`)
- A Gently Stop during a quest step or a long cutscene now stops promptly and leaves the dialogue or scene to you. (`38593b671`, `933fd49ad`)
- Quest turn-ins no longer stall when a cutscene's last choice stays on screen after the scene ends. (`77069f977`)
- Licensed Drakos now signs in on Linux under Wine. (`be98d9361`)
- Signing in again right after a refused license no longer waits 30 seconds for the seat to free up. (`79e5b0e53`)

### In progress

- Diadem gathering, Cosmic Exploration runs, Ishgard Restoration runs and founder pricing at checkout are still being built. (`e5b0db383`, `ee8ed0eb4`)
